   "title": "Watery, high volume, no fever",
   "lines": [
    "• food poisoning: vomiting + diarrhea within HOURS (E. coli, S. aureus, B. cereus)",
    "• cholera: RICE-WATER, travel",
    "• rotavirus, norovirus, Giardia, Cryptosporidium"
   ]
  },
